Create a local SEO-friendly service-area section.

Example:

**Serving [CITY] & Surrounding Areas**

Include customizable nearby cities/communities.

Do not use excessive keyword stuffing.

Make it feel natural.

Example:

"We proudly provide auto glass repair and replacement throughout [City] and surrounding communities."

Include a simple map or visual element if appropriate.

