# 11. FAQ

Create an FAQ section with common auto glass questions.

Include questions such as:

* How much does windshield replacement cost?
* Can my windshield be repaired instead of replaced?
* Do you offer mobile auto glass service?
* How long does windshield replacement take?
* Do you work with insurance?
* What areas do you service?
* Do you replace side and rear glass?
* How soon can I get an appointment?

Use accessible accordion functionality.

The FAQ should be easy to customize.

